---

---

<section
  id="comparativa-sas"
  class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#090e1a] relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300"
>
  <div
    class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-constival-blue/5 dark:bg-constival-blue/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 md:mb-14">
      <span
        class="inline-block py-1.5 px-3 sm:py-2 sm:px-4 bg-constival-teal/10 dark:bg-constival-teal/30 text-constival-teal dark:text-constival-mint font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs sm:text-sm mb-4 border-l-4 border-constival-teal dark:border-constival-mint"
      >
        Comparativa Societaria
      </span>
      <h2
        class="font-sans text-3xl sm:text-4xl 2xl:text-5xl font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white tracking-tight"
      >
        ¿Por qué la S.A.S. <span class="text-constival-mint"
          >aplasta a las opciones antiguas?</span
        >
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
      >
        No todas las figuras societarias son iguales. Compara y decide con datos
        reales cuál es la estructura ideal para tu emprendimiento.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      <!-- SAS Card (Highlighted) -->
      <div
        class="relative bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/60 border-2 border-constival-mint shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,255,178,0.1)] p-5 md:p-6 flex flex-col"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute -top-4 left-6 px-4 py-1.5 bg-constival-mint text-constival-navy font-sans font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest"
        >
          Recomendada
        </div>
        <h3
          class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-1 mt-2 tracking-tight"
        >
          S.A.S.
        </h3>
        <p
          class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 mb-5 uppercase tracking-wider"
        >
          Sociedad por Acciones Simplificada
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 flex-1">
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Capital mínimo: <strong class="text-constival-mint">Desde $1</strong
            >
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Constitución <strong>100% electrónica</strong>
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Sin notarías ni escrituras públicas
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Desde <strong>1 solo accionista</strong>
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            RUC integrado automáticamente
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Plazo: <strong class="text-constival-mint">2 a 3 días</strong>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Limitada Card -->
      <div
        class="relative bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/60 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 p-5 md:p-6 flex flex-col opacity-80"
      >
        <h3
          class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-1 tracking-tight"
        >
          Cía. Ltda.
        </h3>
        <p
          class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 mb-5 uppercase tracking-wider"
        >
          Compañía de Responsabilidad Limitada
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 flex-1">
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Capital mínimo: <strong class="text-red-400"
              >$400 obligatorios</strong
            >
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Requiere escritura pública notariada
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Mínimo <strong>2 socios</strong>
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Responsabilidad limitada al capital
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Plazo: <strong class="text-red-400">3 a 6 semanas</strong>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- S.A. Card -->
      <div
        class="relative bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/60 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 p-5 md:p-6 flex flex-col opacity-80"
      >
        <h3
          class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-1 tracking-tight"
        >
          S.A.
        </h3>
        <p
          class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 mb-5 uppercase tracking-wider"
        >
          Sociedad Anónima
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 flex-1">
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Capital mínimo: <strong class="text-red-400"
              >$800 obligatorios</strong
            >
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Escritura pública + Registro Mercantil
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Mínimo <strong>2 accionistas</strong>
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Estructura pesada de Junta General y Directorio
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-snug"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Plazo: <strong class="text-red-400">3 a 6 semanas</strong>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
